  "body": "**1.** License name: BSD-3 for OpenWebUI\n**2.** Short identifier: OpenWebUI-BSD\n**3.** License author or steward: Created by Timothy Jaeryang Baek\n**4.** Comments: Generally, BSD-3 with some specific attribution requirements for the branding in clauses 4-6.  The issue is that it only seems to apply to OpenWebUI but this appears to be a very popular project so the license is likely to travel.\n**5.** License request Url: https://tools.spdx.org/app/license_requests/500\n**6.** URL(s): https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui/blob/main/LICENSE\n**7.** OSI status: Not Submitted\n**8.** Example projects: https://github.com/open-webui/open-webui",
